14
00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:39.890 line:15%
Even all the things that we've been through,

15
00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:43.280
so this is super fun for me to be able to talk to you.

16
00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:44.150
Are you kidding?

17
00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:46.813
Now you started performing when you were three.

18
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:48.833
Right.

19
00:00:48.833 --> 00:00:51.283
I was introduced as the youngest Osman brother.

20
00:00:52.496 --> 00:00:53.329
