24
00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:02.630
but, it's so interesting,

25
00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:05.390
very much like I have never not worked

26
00:01:05.390 --> 00:01:07.880
a year of my life since then.

27
00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:09.660
I've worked consistently,

28
00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:13.710
whether it was singing in Sweden and performing there,

29
00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:17.500
