124
00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:13.540
And, but now, I wanna go back out on the road.

125
00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:16.150
I'm actually getting ready to do a big symphonic tour.

126
00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:19.880
I just did an album, a 17 song album.

127
00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:23.710
I was doing my research and I was learning about you

128
00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:28.710
