151
00:06:17.172 --> 00:06:18.280
It worked.

152
00:06:18.280 --> 00:06:20.900
You know, we were always best friends,

153
00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:23.930
but I think, so really we didn't even plan it.

154
00:06:23.930 --> 00:06:26.203
It was just so bizarre how it happened.

155
00:06:27.231 --> 00:06:31.270
I had moved to Vegas and we had one child together.

156
