159
00:06:37.617 --> 00:06:38.767
"Can he come help?"

160
00:06:40.511 --> 00:06:43.390
And my, he had never remarried

161
00:06:43.390 --> 00:06:46.730
and I guess I'm a hard habit to break,

162
00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:48.323
no.

163
00:06:48.323 --> 00:06:49.290
