185
00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:36.578
I'm gonna cry.

186
00:07:36.578 --> 00:07:37.553
It was my wedding dress.

187
00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:40.100
Crazy.

188
00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:41.210
To this day, I still don't know where

189
00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:42.640
